'''Silence''' is a [[curse]]<!--Is it a hex?--> that makes affected targets unable to [[cast]] [[spell]]s or use [[warcry|warcries]] for 3 seconds. [[Attack]] skills can still be used.

It is not available as a skill to players.

==Sources==
* {{ml|ChestRandomCurse}} [[Strongbox]]es
* [[Tormented spirit|Tormented]] Blasphemers ({{ml|TormentTouchedMonsterBlasphemer}}, {{ml|TormentHauntedMonsterBlasphemer}})
* [[Tormented spirit|Tormented]] Seditionists ({{ml|TormentTouchedMonsterLibrarian}})
* [[Blood Crucible|Scourge mod]] {{c|mod|(21–30)% chance to Curse you with Silence when Hit}} on helmets

==Immunity to Silence==
* {{il|Star of Wraeclast}}
* [[Jewel]]s can have {{c|mod|You cannot be Cursed with Silence}} [[corrupted]] [[implicit modifier]] ({{ml|V2SilenceImmunityJewelCorrupted}} or {{ml|V2SilenceImmunityJewelCorrupted__}} or legacy mods {{ml|SilenceImmunityAbyssJewelCorrupted}}, {{ml|SilenceImmunityJewelCorrupted}}).

